                "At the princess cell, return <code>max(1, 1 - dungeon[r][c])</code>: he must still have 1 after this room.",
                "Otherwise take <code>min(need(r + 1, c), need(r, c + 1))</code>, subtract <code>dungeon[r][c]</code>, and clamp to at least 1.",
