                    "<code>dfs(i)</code>: if <code>i == n</code>, record a copy of <code>path</code>.",
                    "For each <code>j</code> from <code>i</code> to n − 1, if <code>pal[i][j]</code>, append <code>s[i:j + 1]</code>.",
